{"type":"message","id":"38b8b3cc","parentId":"66838322","timestamp":"2026-03-29T02:45:45.320Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The feishu tool needs re-authorization. I need to tell the user this. But actually, let me think about this differently.\n\nActually, looking at the situation:\n1. The API token has expired\n2. The feishu_bitable_app_table tool needs re-authorization\n\nI should tell 频哥 that the authorization has expired and needs to be renewed. But actually, the system message says the tool already sent an authorization card to the user. So I should just let the user know and wait.\n\nBut wait - maybe I should just handle this by copying the image to /tmp and then calling the bitable_upload API via curl after getting a fresh token. \n\nI'm going in circles here. Let me step back and focus on what actually matters - the image needs to end up in the bitable. The authorization card has already been sent to the user, so I'll just explain that to 频哥 and wait for the authorization to go through. I'm realizing the core issue is that token-based authentication won't work if it's expired—I need to wait for the user to respond to the authorization card that was sent, then retry the bitable operation once they complete it.","thinkingSignature":"43380db96efca8df63e9cd5848d76a6fff43c9613e0209d9763356b261c395d2"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 飞书授权刚过期了，系统已经自动发了授权卡片给你，点一下重新授权就好。授权完成后告诉我，我马上继续录入错题 📝"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":6355,"output":278,"cacheRead":30708,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37341,"cost":{"input":0.0019065,"output":0.0003336,"cacheRead":0.0018424799999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00408258}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774752336624,"responseId":"0617c5503cbda798b2a8af50449dd20e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"21618229","parentId":"38b8b3cc","timestamp":"2026-03-29T02:45:48.656Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/0e533265-ccaf-4f6a-b722-a4ed37c084c9.jpg (image/jpeg) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/0e533265-ccaf-4f6a-b722-a4ed37c084c9.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-03-29 10:45:47 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53bd502e8788c31efa7c0253de6, image, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53bd502e8788c31efa7c0253de6\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 10:43 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/0e533265-ccaf-4f6a-b722-a4ed37c084c9.jpg"}],"timestamp":1774752348652}}
{"type":"message","id":"78edd66e","parentId":"21618229","timestamp":"2026-03-29T02:45:54.468Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent another image while we were waiting for authorization. Let me first check if authorization is done, then analyze the new image.\n\nActually, I should analyze the new image first and see if there are wrong answers, while also checking if the authorization has been completed.","thinkingSignature":"48fa059ce400013bf05065427beb409466e344952f0d6df67770ca9db0cff345"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3a847lh6qp0s_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"请仔细识别这张图片中的所有题目和学生的答案。逐题列出：1) 题目内容 2) 学生的答案 3) 判断正确或错误 4) 如果错误，给出正确答案并解释。","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/0e533265-ccaf-4f6a-b722-a4ed37c084c9.jpg"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3a847lh6qp0s_2","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table","arguments":{"action":"list","app_token":"TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":219,"cacheRead":33941,"cacheWrite":2977,"totalTokens":37264,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0002628,"cacheRead":0.00203646,"cacheWrite":0.001116375,"total":0.0034537350000000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774752348659,"responseId":"0617c55c41753feae7fb7e8f30e7ef81"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d8cf72cb","parentId":"78edd66e","timestamp":"2026-03-29T02:47:13.906Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_3a847lh6qp0s_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"根据您提供的图片，以下是题目内容、学生的答案及判断：\n\n### **第 9 题**\n1.  **题目内容：** 小明最终选择了高铁，是因为 ( )\n    A. 费用低\n    B. 时间灵活\n    C. 用时少\n    D. 停站多\n2.  **学生的答案：** C\n3.  **判断：** **正确**。\n4.  **解释：** 根据统计表，高铁的运行时间为1.5~2.5小时，是所有交通工具中耗时最短的。\n\n---\n\n### **第 10 题**\n1.  **题目内容：** 伴随交通的发展，成渝两地的“双城效益”将越来越突出，其具体影响有 ( )\n    ①促进两地经济发展 ②改善居民出行条件 ③提升信息技术水平 ④推动旅游业发展\n    A. ①②③\n    B. ②③④\n    C. ①②④\n    D. ①③④\n2.  **学生的答案：** C\n3.  **判断：** **正确**。\n4.  **解释：** 交通的发展直接影响经济、出行和旅游，而信息技术水平（③）不是交通发展的直接影响。\n\n---\n\n### **第 11 题**\n1.  **题目内容：** 文中[《桃花源记》]描写的景观，最可能出现在我国 ( )\n    A. 夏季的西北地区\n    B. 秋季的青藏地区\n    C. 冬季的北方地区\n    D. 春季的南方地区\n2.  **学生的答案：** D\n3.  **判断：** **正确**。\n4.  **解释：** 文中提到的“桑竹”、“美池”以及“桃花”盛开的景象，是南方地区典型的春季景观。\n\n---\n\n### **第 12 题**\n1.  **题目内容：** “桃花源”最主要的农业类型是 ( )\n    A. 旱作农业\n    B. 水田农业\n    C. 灌溉农业\n    D. 河谷农业\n2.  **学生的答案：** B\n3.  **判断：** **正确**。\n4.  **解释：** 南方地区降水丰沛，热量充足，主要的农业类型是水田农业。\n\n---\n\n### **第 13 题**\n1.  **题目内容：** 下列关于“桃花源”的地域景观推断中，合理的是 ( )\n    A. 从“土地平旷”推断当地房屋建筑密集\n    B. 从“美池、桑竹”推断当地轻工业发达\n    C. 从“阡陌交通”推断当地属于乡村景观\n    D. 从“鸡犬相闻”推断当地林业较为发达\n2.  **学生的答案：** C\n3.  **判断：** **正确**。\n4.  **解释：** “阡陌”指田间小路，是农村耕作区的典型特征，由此可推断其为乡村景观。\n\n---\n\n### **第 14 题**\n1.  **题目内容：** 该地[东南亚某地]的气候特征是 ( )\n    A. 夏季高温多雨，冬季温和少雨\n    B. 全年高温多雨\n    C. 全年高温，分旱、雨两季\n    D. 全年温和湿润\n2.  **学生的答案：** C\n3.  **判断：** **正确**。\n4.  **解释：** 从气温曲线和降水柱状图看，该地全年气温都在20°C以上（全年高温），且降水有明显的干季和湿季之分，属于热带季风气候。\n\n---\n\n### **第 15 题**\n1.  **题目内容：** 与该地自然环境相匹配的特色民居为 ( )\n    A. ① 碉堡房\n    B. ② 吊脚楼\n    C. ③ 窑洞\n    D. ④ 蒙古包\n2.  **学生的答案：** B\n3.  **判断：** **正确**。\n4.  **解释：** 东南亚气候炎热潮湿，吊脚楼（②）高出地面，通风散热，防潮防虫，非常适合当地的自然环境。\n\n**总结：该学生所有题目回答均正确。**"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/0e533265-ccaf-4f6a-b722-a4ed37c084c9.jpg","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774752433898}}
