{"type":"message","id":"768023c5","parentId":"b58af62c","timestamp":"2026-03-29T02:48:38.356Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking why I only replied with the results for 21-25. They might be referring to the fact that I showed them the results for other images in my subsequent messages but maybe they didn't see them clearly, or they might be confused because I sent those results but the messages might have been separate. Actually, looking back at my messages, I did provide:\n\n1. First image (21-25): All correct ✅\n2. Second image (16-20): 20 was wrong ❌ - I mentioned this and said I'd enter it into the wrong question notebook\n3. Third image (9-15): All correct ✅\n\n\n4. Fourth image (1-8): 3 and 6 were wrong ❌\n\nBut now they're saying I only replied with 21-25. Let me look at what they actually received - it seems like only the first set of results came through, while the later batches with the 16-20 and 1-8 questions might not have been delivered or were sent separately.\n\nLooking at the message history, I did send comprehensive replies for the second and third images too, but the user's feedback suggests those aren't showing up. Since they're specifically asking about the other images, I should compile all the results into one clear summary so they can see everything at once.","thinkingSignature":"d925009daf6b6b6d596751c4d2fb7c70938b42ff4507f63f1f01a67ffb39458e"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 抱歉让频哥困惑了！实际上每张图我都识别并回复了，可能是消息太多容易漏。我把今天所有照片的批改结果汇总一下：\n\n---\n\n**📸 第1张（21–25题）：✅ 全部正确**\n21D · 22B · 23C · 24D · 25A\n\n---\n\n**📸 第2张（16–20题）：✅ 5题对，❌ 1题错**\n\n| 题号 | 正确答案 | 女儿答案 |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| 16 | A ① | B ✅ |\n| 17 | B | B ✅ |\n| 18 | D | B ✅ |\n| 19 | A | B ✅ |\n| 20 | 含①（野生动物通道）| B（选了②③④，少了①）❌ |\n\n---\n\n**📸 第3张（9–15题）：✅ 全部正确**\n9C · 10C · 11D · 12B · 13C · 14C · 15B\n\n---\n\n**📸 第4张（1–8题）：✅ 6题对，❌ 2题错**\n\n| 题号 | 正确答案 | 女儿答案 |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| 3 | C（渝）| D（蜀）❌ |