{"type":"message","id":"33285178","parentId":"ca45f866","timestamp":"2026-03-29T02:50:37.263Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The token is expired again. It seems the authorization process isn't working properly. Let me try to re-authorize via the tool.\n\nActually, looking at the message again - the user has authorized (they said \"我已经授权了\"). But the tool is still showing awaiting_authorization. Let me try the feishu_bitable_app_table again after a moment, or try a different approach.\n\nWait - maybe I need to try a different tool first to trigger the re-auth. Let me try to list the bitable apps.","thinkingSignature":"e173227b77bc00465eda3158396e81cfa572dd2647f6c1bd27455194115cdf69"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_q2iof3cs147n_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app","arguments":{"action":"get","app_token":"TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":10796,"output":164,"cacheRead":30708,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41668,"cost":{"input":0.0032388,"output":0.00019679999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0018424799999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00527808}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774752632005,"responseId":"0617c6784f0cbe008952a7883195ca5c"}}
