{"type":"message","id":"2a086606","parentId":"21102238","timestamp":"2026-03-29T02:50:49.551Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The authorization issue persists. The user says they've authorized, but the system keeps asking for authorization. This seems like the auth token stored in keychain is expired, and the system is trying to do a re-auth but the user may not be completing it properly.\n\nWait - the user said \"我已经授权了\" (I've already authorized). Maybe they clicked the auth card but something went wrong. Let me try a different approach - maybe I need to use the feishu_oauth_batch_auth tool or the user needs to do something specific.\n\nActually, let me look at what the user received. They received an \"授权引导卡片\" which is an auth card. They need to click on it to authorize. \n\nLet me tell the user clearly that the system is still showing authorization is needed, and ask them to try clicking the card again or let me know when they've completed the authorization.\n\nActually, wait - let me re-read the flow. The user provided the direct link to the table, which means they might have already authorized through their browser session. \n\nThe issue might be that the authorization token in the keychain is expired and needs to be refreshed. I should try calling the batch_auth tool to get a fresh token.","thinkingSignature":"46cf9fe580037e1d2d260aa02b1d478ce197c12ccb81984bc0229635f043269b"},{"type":"text","text":"\n[[reply_to_current]] 奇怪，系统还是显示需要授权。可能授权卡片的点击没成功。麻烦再点一次授权卡片，或者告诉我你有没有看到任何授权提示？\n\n如果实在看不到提示，我可以直接用 API 手动录入——只需要知道错题本里有哪些字段就行（比如\"题目\"、\"正确答案\"、\"学科\"之类的），你能截个字段设置的截图给我吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":11051,"output":324,"cacheRead":30708,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42083,"cost":{"input":0.0033152999999999998,"output":0.00038879999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0018424799999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00554658}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774752638253,"respons