{"type":"message","id":"8b199ba9","parentId":"516acabe","timestamp":"2026-03-29T02:52:18.846Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me upload these images to Feishu using the direct API approach, getting the access token from keychain first.\n\nActually, I need to get a fresh access token. Let me check if the feishu plugin refreshed it automatically. Let me try the direct API approach.\n\nFor bitable image upload, I need to:\n1. Get user access token from keychain\n2. Use drive/v1/files/upload_all API with parent_type=bitable_image and extra={\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"tblJ7fKHxchaECKz\"}}\n3. Get file_token\n4. Update the records with the file_token in the 原图 field\n\n\n5. \nLet me start by retrieving the access token from keychain.","thinkingSignature":"87ee65d70f8b343fa969d3ad9fd931f45336510e41dd8b2c2b4eb1cccf869780"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_y7yv1vg2n9f6_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"FULL_TOKEN=$(security find-generic-password -s \"openclaw-feishu-uat\" -a \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3:ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\" -w)\nACCESS_TOKEN=$(echo \"$FULL_TOKEN\" | python3 -c \"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(d.get('accessToken',''))\")\necho \"Token starts with: ${ACCESS_TOKEN:0:15}...\"\n\n# Upload q20 image\nSIZE_Q20=$(stat -f%z /tmp/wrong_q20.jpg)\nRESPONSE_Q20=$(curl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $ACCESS_TOKEN\" \\\n  -F \"file_name=wrong_q20.jpg\" \\\n  -F \"parent_type=bitable_image\" \\\n  -F \"parent_node=TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1\" \\\n  -F \"size=$SIZE_Q20\" \\\n  -F \"file=@/tmp/wrong_q20.jpg;type=image/jpeg\" \\\n  -F 'extra={\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"tblJ7fKHxchaECKz\"}}')\necho \"Q20 upload: $RESPONSE_Q20\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":17015,"output":471,"cacheRead":30708,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48194,"cost":{"input":0.