{"type":"message","id":"d42c3930","parentId":"e3738887","timestamp":"2026-03-29T02:53:43.437Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_q8puxir6vv7s_1","toolName":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"records\": [\n    {\n      \"fields\": {\n        \"原图\": [\n          {\n            \"file_token\": \"QgFWbtKEuoX0fFx8s1lcJJ6hnMf\",\n            \"name\": \"wrong_topic.jpg\",\n            \"size\": 4916944,\n            \"tmp_url\": \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/batch_get_tmp_download_url?file_tokens=QgFWbtKEuoX0fFx8s1lcJJ6hnMf\",\n            \"type\": \"image/jpeg\",\n            \"url\": \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/QgFWbtKEuoX0fFx8s1lcJJ6hnMf/download\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"题目内容\": [\n          {\n            \"text\": \"（锦江区期末）一次函数y=kx+b的图象与x轴交于点A(6,0)，与y轴交于点B(0,3)，与正比例函数y=x的图象交于点C。\\n(1) 求一次函数的解析式及点C的坐标。\\n(2) 在y轴上是否存在一点P，使△BCP是等腰三角形？若存在，请直接写出点P的坐标；若不存在，请说明理由。\\n(3) 过点C作CD⊥x轴于点D，E是线段OD上一点，F是y轴正半轴上一点，且∠ECF=45°，连接EF，求△OEF的面积的最大值。\",\n            \"type\": \"text\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"record_id\": \"recvf7BUzqEFSD\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fields\": {\n        \"原图\": [\n          {\n            \"file_token\": \"KRYxbbwgwoRVzlxZ3tscREbRnjg\",\n            \"name\": \"english_unit2.jpg\",\n            \"size\": 230845,\n            \"tmp_url\": \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/batch_get_tmp_download_url?file_tokens=KRYxbbwgwoRVzlxZ3tscREbRnjg\",\n            \"type\": \"image/jpeg\",\n            \"url\": \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/KRYxbbwgwoRVzlxZ3tscREbRnjg/download\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"题目内容\": [\n          {\n            \"text\": \"（B卷·Unit 2 Stay Healthy）短文填空：阅读短文，从给定12个备选词（happy, hurt, we, other, matter, pain, quick, harm, thank, luck, describe, careless）中选择正确形式填入10个空格。短文讲述一人下班回家后突发心脏病被送往医院救治的经历。\",\n            \"type\": \"text\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"record_id\": \"recvf7PmchaMw2\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fields\": {\n        \"原图\": [\n          {\n            \"file_token\": \"UP3TbLDzloYDcKxWlhMcGZponrh\",\n            \"name\": \"math_inequality.jpg\",\n            \"size\": 235941,\n            \"tmp_url\": \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/batch_get_tmp_download_url?file_tokens=UP3TbLDzloYDcKxWlhMcGZponrh\",\n            \"type\": \"image/jpeg\",\n            \"url\": \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/UP3TbLDzloYDcKxWlhMcGZponrh/download\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"题目内容\": [\n          {\n            \"text\": \"（名校题库·八年级下）不等式组综合练习：\\n(一) 有解：概率问题 — 抽卡使不等式组有解的概率\\n(二) 有解：求 a 的取值范围\\n(三) 无解：求 m 的取值范围（高新/锦江/青羊区期末）\\n(四) 整数解：求参数的取值范围（温江/天府七中/九中光华/嘉祥/石室北湖/川师附中/实外）\",\n            \"type\": \"text\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"record_id\": \"recvf7STZ1170n\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"has_more\": true,\n  \"page_token\": \"cGFnZVRva2VuOjM=\",\n  \"total\": 16\n}"}],"details":{"records":[{"fields":{"原图":[{"file_token":"QgFWbtKEuoX0fFx8s1lcJJ6hnMf","name":"wrong_topic.jpg","size":4916944,"tmp_url":"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/batch_get_tmp_download_url?file_tokens=QgFWbtKEuoX0fFx8s1lcJJ6hnMf","type":"image/jpeg","url":"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/QgFWbtKEuoX0fFx8s1lcJJ6hnMf/download"}],"题目内容":[{"text":"（锦江区期末）一次函数y=kx+b的图象与x轴交于点A(6,0)，与y轴交于点B(0,3)，与正比例函数y=x的图象交于点C。\n(1) 求一次函数的解析式及点C的坐标。\n(2) 在y轴上是否存在一点P，使△BCP是等腰三角形？若存在，请直接写出点P的坐标；若不存在，请说明理由。\n(3) 过点C作CD⊥x轴于点D，E是线段OD上一点，F是y轴正半轴上一点，且∠ECF=45°，连接EF，求△OEF的面积的最大值。","type":"text"}]},"record_id":"recvf7BUzqEFSD"},{"fields":{"原图":[{"file_token":"KRYxbbwgwoRVzlxZ3tscREbRnjg","name":"english_unit2.jpg","size":230845,"tmp_url":"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/batch_get_tmp_download_url?file_tokens=KRYxbbwgwoRVzlxZ3tscREbRnjg","type":"image/jpeg","url":"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/medias/KRYxbbwgwoRVzlxZ3tscREbRnjg/download"}],"题目内容":[{"text":"（B卷