{"type":"message","id":"36d2f57c","parentId":"93bf282a","timestamp":"2026-03-29T03:34:52.437Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I should reply to the user acknowledging that I should have used the self-improvement skill and have now logged it properly.","thinkingSignature":"1225cf1f5c063dacb6555289859ec8b2495925989aa1450a86a4fe59364e942c"},{"type":"text","text":"已补录到 `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md` 和 MEMORY.md ✅\n\n你说的对，这是一个很好的触发点——**用户纠正我** → 应该立即触发 self-improvement skill，自动记录到 learnings 文件夹，而不是只在对话里说说过就忘了。\n\n我现在的习惯是\"在对话里回复\"，但正确的做法应该是\"对话里回复 + 立即写文件\"两条腿走路。以后会注意。🍎"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":36115,"output":114,"cacheRead":30708,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":66937,"cost":{"input":0.010834499999999999,"output":0.0001368,"cacheRead":0.0018424799999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.012813779999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774755286295,"responseId":"0617d0d66e41bfa6d5f13b4598acdc3b"}}
{"type":"message","id":"89d13118","parentId":"36d2f57c","timestamp":"2026-03-29T05:07:06.748Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-29 13:07:05 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53bf7946c93cc2d5cd901e5e469]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53bf7946c93cc2d5cd901e5e469\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 13:07 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n周深这个人咋样"}],"timestamp":1774760826743}}
{"type":"message","id":"48ddd3d7","parentId":"89d13118","timestamp":"2026-03-29T05:07:22.103Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user (频哥) is asking about 周深 (Zhou Shen), the singer. I know a lot about him from the USER.md file. Let me share my thoughts about him in a casual, conversational way - not just reciting facts but giving an impression. I should talk about what makes him interesting as a person and artist, in a natural, warm tone that fits my persona.","thinkingSignature":"dc741b555e0c7662b1364bbb4e85f1964dcb2fe2a98fe6830f48a971d309db0d"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 周深啊，我挺欣赏他的。\n\n**声音是老天爷追着喂饭那种。** 空灵、干净、高音能飘到没朋友，但也因为这个音色太特别，早年参加《声入人心》的时候被说过\"声音不像男生\"，质疑声不少。他后来的回应不是辩解，是默默用实力证明——\"我不是天才，我是努力型\"这句话是他自己说的，不是别人贴的标签。\n\n**性格挺有意思的。** 台上唱歌仙气飘飘，台下其实很害羞，爱在微博回复粉丝被叫\"人工客服\"，还爱跟粉丝斗嘴叫\"怼怼\"。这种反差挺真实的，不装。\n\n**他身上有一点我觉得对女儿有参考价值：** 他音色独特，早年反而是被嘲笑的原因。但他没有去模仿主流男声的唱法，而是把独特性保留下来，最后成了标志。**找到自己的特点，比变成别人更重要。**\n\n你女儿喜欢他的哪几首歌来着？《化身孤岛的鲸》《未闻花名》那些？频哥可以找时间问问她为什么喜欢，说不定能聊出些有意思的东西 🍎"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":307,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":66526,"totalTokens":66960,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0003684,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.02494725,"total":0.02535375}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774760826754,"responseId":"0617e67b83e4565154b37c99fcc99e4f"}}
